MERN + TypeScript retail ERP: auth, products, categories, POS/sales, purchases, payments, deliveries, expenses, stock adjustments, barcode scanning, dashboard analytics. 30 concrete findings across backend and frontend, plus a phased plan to reach a trustworthy MVP release.

